## 2. HLD vs LLD

| Aspect | HLD | LLD |
|--------|-----|-----|
| **Scope** | System-wide architecture | Module / class / method level |
| **Audience** | Architects, managers, stakeholders | Developers |
| **Detail Level** | Abstract, high-level boxes | Concrete, code-level detail |
| **Focus** | Components, data flow, tech choices | Classes, methods, algorithms |
| **Diagrams** | Block diagrams, deployment diagrams | Class diagrams, sequence diagrams |
| **Output** | Architecture document | Code-ready design document |
| **Example** | "User service stores data in PostgreSQL" | "`UserRepository.findById(Long id): User`" |
| **Timing** | Before implementation begins | After HLD is approved |
| **Design Patterns** | Architectural patterns (CQRS, Saga) | GoF patterns (Singleton, Factory) |

