└── void executeMove(Move)

Piece (abstract)
├── Color color
├── Position position
└── List<Position> getValidMoves(Board) — abstract

King / Queen / Rook / Bishop / Knight / Pawn
└── override getValidMoves()

Move
├── Piece piece
