## 25. Quick Reference Cheat Sheet

### SOLID — One-Liner Summary

| Principle | One-Liner |
|-----------|-----------|
| **S** — SRP | One class = one reason to change |
| **O** — OCP | Extend behavior, don't edit existing code |
| **L** — LSP | Subtypes must be fully substitutable |
| **I** — ISP | Fine-grained interfaces over fat ones |
| **D** — DIP | Depend on abstractions, not concretions |

