### Common LLD Anti-Patterns to Avoid

| Anti-Pattern | Problem | Fix |
|-------------|---------|-----|
| **God Class** | One class does everything | Split by SRP |
| **Anemic Domain Model** | Classes with only getters/setters, no behavior | Add behavior to domain objects |
| **Shotgun Surgery** | One change requires edits in many classes | Apply SRP + high cohesion |
| **Divergent Change** | One class changes for many reasons | Apply SRP |
| **Feature Envy** | Method uses data of another class excessively | Move method to the other class |
| **Primitive Obsession** | Using primitives instead of value objects | Extract small classes (Money, Address) |
| **Data Clumps** | Same group of fields appear together often | Extract into a class |
| **Switch Statements** | Long switch on type codes | Polymorphism / Strategy pattern |
| **Parallel Inheritance Hierarchies** | Adding a subclass requires adding in two hierarchies | Bridge pattern or flatten |
| **Lazy Class** | Class that does too little to justify existence | Inline it |

